  "reason": "authenticity lane-A 2026-10-10: rig adds the articulated whip (inferno_whipchain Whip_00..09 on the traced whip, pit fiend values; it was one rigid RightHand prop) and floaterFix moves left-hand / fist / whip slivers off the thighs and deletes the 99-vert Meshy fork of the whip hooked in behind the feet. keyRotations (half offset, applied twice), same g12/g05 DEF as the pit fiend (spec ported): AttackFront whip raised f1, swung overhead f2, lashed straight out in front f3-f4, looped back f5, trailing f6, with the right arm overhead and a spine lunge; Death arms and whip flung up f1-f3 then a hunched heap with the whip laid out in front. diffuseWeights smooths the Hips/UpLeg/Spine crotch mix so the fold does not tear; stretchRelax evens the re-baked whip and fold edges. || floorPlant (lane B 2026-10-10): feet planted at MoveStart/MoveEnd/Hitted/AttackFront keys (Hips rises by the smaller sink, other leg two-bone IK'd), Hitted key 0 lowered onto the floor so grounding's entry no longer sinks key 1, whip lifted off the floor at MoveStart/MoveEnd/Hitted keys and Hitted/AttackFront in-betweens (AttackFront whip was 70 cm under the floor between keys 6-7)",
